--[[
    Looting Takes Time Enhanced (Tarkov like looting)
    Original by: xcvb
    Re-written & improved by: Abraham (Priler)
    Github repo: https://github.com/Priler/tarkov_looting
    
    Check out ModDB page for more details: https://www.moddb.com/mods/stalker-anomaly/addons/looting-takes-time-redux-tarkov-like-looting

    Patched by "Fix HD Inventory Icon Position": get_sort_info now returns
    rendered cell sizes (inv_grid dims divided by inv_grid_scale, honoring
    icon_override.ltx like the rest of the UI). The corpse grid layout this
    mod precomputes is placed via TakeRoom, which works in rendered cells;
    with raw dims, HD icons reserved double-size tiles and the loot window
    showed cell-wide gaps between items. Only get_sort_info changed.
--]]



-- Fix HD Inventory Icon Position: this file is an override patch for Looting
-- Takes Time REDUX. If that mod is not installed, its MCM companion script
-- (zzzz_loot_searching_mcm) is absent -- bail out before applying any of its
-- UI monkeypatches, since the mod's XML and sound assets would be missing too
-- (ParseFile on a missing xml crashes the game).
if not zzzz_loot_searching_mcm then
    return
end



